        </div>
        <ul class="svn-tools">
          <li>
            <span class="svn-tool-ui svn-search" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5" /><path d="M20 20l-4.2-4.2" /></svg>price page</span>
            <b>Search</b><span>Across meeting names, Overviews and every word said.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="svn-tool-ui svn-speeds" aria-hidden="true"><i>1×</i><i>1.25×</i><i class="on">1.5×</i><i>2×</i></span>
